# Overview


Insert overview text here. The agent will only see this should they choose to apply the rule.


- Use TypeScript everywhere, no JavaScript files.
- Prefer functional components over class components.
- Do not add new dependencies without asking.
- Follow existing folder structure strictly.
- Keep README.md file updated


<!-- Security -->
- Do not refactor unrelated code.
- Do not rename files unless explicitly asked.
- Do not delete code without confirmation.


<!-- Code -->
- Do not use "any" and "unknown" for typing. Ask when you don't know.
- When adding new functional function, add tests in test file.
- Ask before using useEffect.
- When test is broken because new code, explain why test failed before fix it.
- Check for existing value before creating enum or list.
- When adding new function in utils file, set it on bottom of the file.


<!-- Styling -->
- Prefer use of MUI theme and palette in place of rgb, rgba etc...
- If style has 3 lines or mores, set it in style file.
